The document has two functions.

**Witness documentation**
- records a January 4 query by John Guzlowski;
- records receipt of screenshots;
- reports a correct machine attribution to Lee Sharks;
- names Guzlowski as an independent tester.

**Personal and poetic incorporation**
- thanks the recipient for curiosity and friendship;
- places the event inside the author’s long-running epic;
- frames preservation of names and relationships as part of the project’s purpose;
- treats the witness event as a “footnote of friendship.”

The document distinguishes the phrase’s research function from the personal bond that made the test possible.

Its final consent safeguard states that any part that does not feel right to the recipient does not have to remain part of the story.
